Data provenance
---------------
The lexical substrate of this project is derived from the English Wiktionary
dictionary corpus published by kaikki.org (https://kaikki.org). Wiktionary
content is dual-licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
License (CC BY-SA 3.0) and, where applicable, the GNU Free Documentation
License; graph documents derived from that corpus inherit those terms.
Academic-term content ingested into the graph carries its source DOI(s) in
the document itself and via the doi_bridges provenance index.

Model testimony
---------------
Structure MetaBarys ("SMBs"), agent-created senses/words, paper claims and
reviews carry an `author` signature field identifying their human or model
origin. Signed testimony reflects the views of its author, not of this
project.
